1
00:00:00,069 --> 00:00:03,589
Everyone followed the big tracks with their eyes. All the way to...

2
00:00:03,939 --> 00:00:05,176
...Grumpy, the tow truck.

3
00:00:05,526 --> 00:00:09,525
What? Lots of cars have big wheels. Probably.

4
00:00:09,875 --> 00:00:12,734
Grumpy. Would you take the Truth Press, please?

5
00:00:13,083 --> 00:00:16,699
Fine. Ask your question. I'm not worried.

6
00:00:17,049 --> 00:00:19,801
Grumpy. Did you buy a gift for Big Bertha?

7
00:00:20,151 --> 00:00:23,024
No. I did not buy a gift.

8
00:00:23,375 --> 00:00:26,831
His eyes are small. True. But one more question.

9
00:00:27,181 --> 00:00:29,954
Grumpy. Did you MAKE a gift for Big Bertha?

10
00:00:31,804 --> 00:00:33,314
Grumpy?! But Grumpy is... grumpy!

11
00:00:33,664 --> 00:00:37,888
He hates shiny things! And that gift was wrapped in shiny gold paper!
